gb31(){return"Colleagues view tour"},
gb3R(){return"Navigate Weeks"},
gb3Q(){return"Use Today and the arrows to move between weeks. The week label shows which week you're viewing."},
gb3N(){return"Your Draft Actions"},
gb3M(){return"In Colleagues view you draft your own row. 'Copy last week' fills your empty days from last week, and the amber hint reminds you that your manager publishes your final schedule."},
gatq(){return"Draft Your Own Shifts"},
gatp(){return"Tap an empty day on your row to propose a shift, or tap your own draft to edit it. Days your manager has reserved show a lock and can't be edited. Your drafts stay pending until your manager publishes them."},
gab4(){return"Request a Swap"},
gab3(){return"Tap a colleague's shift to request a swap with them. You can only swap future shifts, and not when either of you is on leave or already has an open request for that day."},
gb3L(){return"Manager Comparison Row"},
gb3K(){return"This pinned row shows your manager's schedule for reference (read-only, marked with a 'Manager' badge) so you can line your own shifts up against theirs."},
gb3J(){return"Pick a Week"},
gb3I(){return"Tap the arrows to move between weeks; the label in the middle shows the week you're viewing."},
gb3D(){return"Week at a Glance"},
gb3C(){return"Quick totals for the week: people scheduled and shifts always show; in Team view you also see conflicts and unpublished drafts."},
gb3z(){return"Choose a Day"},
gb3y(){return"Tap a day to focus the list below on that day's shifts. Swipe the strip sideways to reach the whole week."},
gate(){return"Bulk Assign Shifts"},
gatd(){return"Tap 'Assign shifts\u2026' to open the bulk sheet and give the same shift to several people across several days at once \u2014 it walks you through the shift (template or custom times), the days, then who it applies to. The 'Fill this day' link above the list does the same for just the day you're viewing."},
gb3H(){return"Schedule Views"},
gb3G(){return"Swipe the tab strip to move between views: Weekly (the day-by-day list below), Monthly for a whole-month overview, On Shift Now for who's working right now, My Schedule for your own shifts, and Swaps \u2014 its badge counts requests waiting on you. Managers also get a More tab for publishing and copying."},
gatg(){return"Filter the Team"},
